## 🌟 Overview

**ChessMaster: Black Bishop Edition** is built for chess enthusiasts, learners, and analysts. It provides an offline, self-contained chess environment combining responsive board mechanics, adjustable AI engine strengths, dynamic clock modes, and customizable visual themes.

---

## ✨ Features

* **⚡ Stockfish AI Engine:** Adjustable difficulty levels suitable for casual play up to grandmaster-level positional analysis.
* **⏱️ DGT 3000 Style Clock:** Fischer/Bronstein delay & increment modes, blitz, rapid, and classic tournament time controls.
* **🎨 Visual Customization:** High-contrast custom piece sets and dark/light board themes.
* **📦 100% Portable:** Single standalone application without requiring external python environments or dependency installation.

