## 🔑 Activation Guide

1. Launch `ChessMaster.exe`.
2. Locate the activation window and take note of your **Machine Lock Code** (or run `crack/ckInfo+.exe`).
3. Open `crack/Bishop_keygen.exe`, enter your username and lock code.
4. Generate the key, paste it into the activation dialog, and unlock the full workstation.

